OL,3,ABrazilians choosing between Lula and
OL,4,ABolsonaro's son in presidential
OL,5,Aelection run-off
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazilians are voting to choose their
OL,8,Fnew president in a closely fought
OL,9,Frun-off election - polls will close at
OL,10,F17:00 local time (20:00 GMT)
OL,12,FIt is the second round of voting after
OL,13,Fright-wing senator Flavio Bolsonaro won
OL,14,Fthe first round earlier this month -
OL,15,Fbeating incumbent President Luiz Inacio
OL,16,FLula da Silva, known widely as Lula
OL,18,FBolsonaro is the son of former
OL,19,Fpresident Jair Bolsonaro, who was given
OL,20,Fa 27-year prison sentence for a failed
OL,21,Fcoup after losing the 2022 election,
OL,22,Fand is now under house arrest
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
