OL,3,ABrazilians choosing between Lula and
OL,4,ABolsonaro's son in presidential
OL,5,Aelection run-off
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlavio Bolsonaro secured 47% of the
OL,8,Fvote to Lula's 45% in the first round,
OL,9,Fexceeding expectations but falling
OL,10,Fshort of an outright majority
OL,12,FArriving at a polling station in Rio de
OL,13,FJaneiro early this morning, Bolsonaro
OL,14,Ftold reporters the "time has come for
OL,15,Freal change"
OL,17,FMeanwhile, Lula greeted supporters
OL,18,Foutside a polling station as he cast
OL,19,Fhis vote in Sao Bernardo do Campo
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
